const T={clay:"#d9844b",clayL:"#eda877",clayD:"#b2602d",glaze:"#1e140f",white:"#f3e8d4",red:"#8f2d1d",dil:"#cf9f5c",olive:"#6f6a36"};
let FOE=false;/* black-figure mode */
